{"body":"## What this changes\n\nRolls back three pull requests of the issue 655 orchestrator build that are on master, at Clay's request (2026-11-20), so master is back where Ryan's issue-watcher work left off. `/sc:closeout` (#683) is kept. Reverted, newest first:\n\n- #684 move the agent-work-report skill into IronClaude (d7d645ddd)\n- #682 retire the old plan-approval gate (01e7a9e23). This restores the `issue-pipeline` command group and its tests (Ryan's Plan A #584 and Plan B #591), `WORKER-CONTRACT.md` rule WC-17 and its \"Issue pipeline duties\" section, and the first G2 rule of `launch-level-guard.sh` (source and plugin copy).\n- #681 the orchestrator design `docs/designs/orchestrator.md` (c2a139552)\n\nThe branch reverts all four and then re-applies #683 in a second commit.\n\n## What does not change\n\n- `/sc:closeout` (#683) stays. Its files are unchanged from master except `WORKER-CONTRACT.md` and `tests/skills/test_worker_contract.py`, which now hold both the restored WC-17 rules and the closeout never-as-worker entries, and `CHANGELOG.md`, which keeps only the closeout entry.\n- Otherwise only files #681, #682 and #684 touched change, each back to its state before #681.\n- #688 and #694, merged after them, are untouched (their files are identical to master). Nothing merged before #681 is affected.\n\n## Where the rolled-back work is kept\n\n- `clayphi/archive-orchestrator-655-20261120`: master at d7d645ddd, with #681 to #684.\n- Open PRs #686 and #690 stay as drafts; every unfinished build branch (`clayphi/issue-655-pr-b-*`, `clayphi/issue-655-spec`, `clayphi/orchestrator-655-hub`, `clayphi/issue-668*`) is pushed.\n\n## Tests\n\n`pytest tests/skills/test_closeout_protocol.py tests/skills/test_worker_contract.py tests/recommend/test_routing_refresh.py tests/issue_pipeline tests/cli/test_issue_pipeline_registered.py tests/hooks/test_launch_level_guard_worker.py tests/issue_watch`: 4063 passed.\n\nRefs #655\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n","files":[{"path":"CHANGELOG.md","additions":0,"deletions":8,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"docs/architecture/SUPERVISED-ORCHESTRATION-TECHNICAL-REFERENCE.md","additions":1,"deletions":1,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"docs/designs/orchestrator.md","additions":0,"deletions":1412,"changeType":"DELETED"},{"path":"docs/user-guide/cli-groups.md","additions":6,"deletions":4,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"plugins/superclaude/hooks/scripts/launch-level-guard.sh","additions":5,"deletions":2,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/superclaude/cli/issue_pipeline/__init__.py","additions":5,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"src/superclaude/cli/issue_pipeline/approval_line.py","additions":62,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"src/superclaude/cli/issue_pipeline/approval_record.py","additions":416,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"src/superclaude/cli/issue_pipeline/brief.py","additions":74,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"src/superclaude/cli/issue_pipeline/cli.py","additions":395,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"src/superclaude/cli/issue_pipeline/plan_hash.py","additions":90,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"src/superclaude/cli/issue_pipeline/reads.py","additions":161,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"src/superclaude/cli/issue_pipeline/release.py","additions":66,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"src/superclaude/cli/issue_pipeline/stage_predicates.py","additions":301,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"src/superclaude/cli/issue_pipeline/templates/worker-brief.txt","additions":27,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"src/superclaude/cli/main.py","additions":4,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/superclaude/core/WORKER-CONTRACT.md","additions":12,"deletions":1,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/superclaude/hooks/scripts/launch-level-guard.sh","additions":5,"deletions":2,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/superclaude/skills/agent-wor